# The shared session warehouse in ClickHouse: `make clickhouse` (session-analytics warehouse --clickhouse), and the
# SessionEnd hook once this is filled in. It lives at ~/.config/convo-analysis/.env — `make env` (warehouse
# --init-env) creates it from this template — outside any checkout or plugin directory, so updates never take it.
# Only that file is read, never the environment, so a CLICKHOUSE_URL exported for another project can't redirect
# the load. Only sessions in which the rde skill ran are shared (CLICKHOUSE_SKILLS below) — each of them whole,
# every turn, tool call, file path and error in it — and a sync changes this machine's rows only (plus the shared
# topic/layer lists, when its version is newer); other people's stay. Once CLICKHOUSE_URL is set, the SessionEnd
# hook shares each such session as it ends. `warehouse --clickhouse-forget` takes sessions out and keeps them out.
#
# The HTTPS endpoint of the cluster, with a user that can create, insert into, rename, exchange and drop tables and
# create views in the database named at the end. That database must already exist (nothing here creates one), and
# a table there of the same name that this didn't create stops the load:
#   CLICKHOUSE_URL=https://<user>:<password>@<host>:8443/sessions
# The JDBC string from the ClickHouse Cloud console works as it is (jdbc:clickhouse://<host>:8443?user=…&password=…
# &ssl=true; no database in it means `sessions`), and so does clickhouse://…?secure=true. Only ClickHouse's HTTP
# interface is used: port 8443 (TLS) or 8123.
CLICKHOUSE_URL=
# Optional: the password on its own, when it holds characters a URL would need escaped (@ : / # ? %).
CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD=

# Optional: the database, when the URL does not end with one (default: sessions).
CLICKHOUSE_DATABASE=

# Optional: the name on your rows (the `person` column the dashboard can group by). Default: your git email.
CLICKHOUSE_PERSON=

# Optional: which sessions are shared — those in which one of these skills ran, comma separated (a plugin's
# `…:rde` counts; `agent-skills:rde` means only that plugin's). Default: rde. `*` shares every session.
CLICKHOUSE_SKILLS=
